<title>FRANCE: BHV 1997 H1 SALES RISE.</title>
<headline>BHV 1997 H1 SALES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				1,685.9 vs 1,670.9</p>
<p>	 -- includes Q2			862.4 vs   834.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Retail company BHV gave its first-half sales in the official bulletin BALO.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
